{"seq":3,"slug":"ap-controls-metrics-audit","title":"AP 内控、度量指标与审计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/accounts-payable-invoice-automation/ap-fraud-working-capital/ap-controls-metrics-audit","wordCount":2797,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"ap-内控-度量指标与审计\">AP 内控、度量指标与审计</h1><p>审计师翻到 AP 底稿时问的从来不是&quot;你们有没有审批流程&quot;，而是&quot;请出示某张发票由谁录入、由谁审批、依据哪一条容差、以及为什么审批人与录入人不是同一个账号&quot;。自动化把控制点从人眼搬进了代码，失效模式也跟着换位：一句 <code>if (approver === creator) reject</code> 可以被一次错误的权限配置或一个离职未回收的账号悄然绕过。本篇处理三件事：把控制设计成可被系统强制执行的层级、用指标把控制有效性变成可观测的数、让审计轨迹能重放一笔付款的&quot;为什么&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>AP 的每条控制都可以按&quot;何时介入&quot;归入三层，而<strong>同一风险必须在不同层各布一道</strong>：预防控制拦在动作发生前（未通过三单匹配的发票进不了付款批次）；检测控制发生在动作后、损失扩大前（日终重算已付款清单，扫描同供应商同金额同发票号的重复）；纠正控制处理已发生的偏差（付款追回、对账调整、控制参数修正）。用<strong>三线模型</strong>（<a href=\"https://www.theiia.org/en/content/position-papers/2020/the-iia-three-lines-model-an-update-of-the-three-lines-of-defense/\">The IIA, Three Lines Model, 2020</a>）看，业务线执行控制，风控/合规定义标准并监测，内部审计独立验证控制是否真在运行——<strong>第三线不能由第一线兼任</strong>，这是内审独立性的底线。</p>\n<p>对上市公司这套结构不是自愿的：美国《萨班斯-奥克斯利法案》（<a href=\"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/PLAW-107publ204/pdf/PLAW-107publ204.pdf\">SOX, 2002</a>）第 404 条要求管理层评估财务报告内部控制有效性并出报告，审计师依 <a href=\"https://pcaobus.org/oversight/standards/auditing-standards/details/AS2201\">PCAOB AS 2201</a> 出具意见。AP 是采购到付款循环的出口，付款出错直接污染财报与现金余额，几乎总被识别为<strong>关键控制</strong>。</p>\n<p>控制点与失效模式必须成对设计，把&quot;控制&quot;和&quot;它防的具体错误&quot;写在一起才可测试：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[发票进入 AP 系统] --&gt; B{预防层: 匹配校验}&#10;  B --&gt;|不通过| B1[阻断入批次&lt;br/&gt;转例外队列]&#10;  B --&gt;|通过| C{预防层: 主数据校验}&#10;  C --&gt;|银行账号近期变更| C1[强制二次验证&lt;br/&gt;冻结付款]&#10;  C --&gt;|账号稳定| D{预防层: 权限校验}&#10;  D --&gt;|录入人=审批人| D1[拒绝并记异常]&#10;  D --&gt;|角色合规| E[进入付款批次]&#10;  E --&gt; F{检测层: 日终重算}&#10;  F --&gt;|发现重复/异常| G[冻结并转调查]&#10;  F --&gt;|通过| H[执行付款]&#10;  H --&gt; I{检测层: 落地对账}&#10;  I --&gt;|残差无法归因| J[例外队列]&#10;  I --&gt;|对账一致| K[过账与归档]&#10;  G --&gt; L[纠正层: 追回/调整]&#10;  J --&gt; L&#10;  L --&gt; M[更新控制参数并回归验证]\">graph TD\n  A[发票进入 AP 系统] --&gt; B{预防层: 匹配校验}\n  B --&gt;|不通过| B1[阻断入批次&lt;br/&gt;转例外队列]\n  B --&gt;|通过| C{预防层: 主数据校验}\n  C --&gt;|银行账号近期变更| C1[强制二次验证&lt;br/&gt;冻结付款]\n  C --&gt;|账号稳定| D{预防层: 权限校验}\n  D --&gt;|录入人=审批人| D1[拒绝并记异常]\n  D --&gt;|角色合规| E[进入付款批次]\n  E --&gt; F{检测层: 日终重算}\n  F --&gt;|发现重复/异常| G[冻结并转调查]\n  F --&gt;|通过| H[执行付款]\n  H --&gt; I{检测层: 落地对账}\n  I --&gt;|残差无法归因| J[例外队列]\n  I --&gt;|对账一致| K[过账与归档]\n  G --&gt; L[纠正层: 追回/调整]\n  J --&gt; L\n  L --&gt; M[更新控制参数并回归验证]</pre><p>最容易漏掉的是<strong>检测层与预防层的独立性</strong>：若两者共享同一份规则代码，这段代码的同一个 bug 会让两层同时失效。&quot;日终重算&quot;应使用独立的只读付款快照，而非复用预防阶段的中间结果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"职责分离在自动化-ap-中的落地\">职责分离在自动化 AP 中的落地</h2><p>职责分离（segregation of duties, SoD）的实质是<strong>任何一个人都不应同时掌握&quot;发起、批准、记录、保管&quot;中的多项</strong>。在 AP 里这四个动作对应五个系统角色，必须两两互斥：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>可执行</th>\n<th>与谁互斥</th>\n<th>失效后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>发票录入 / 导入</td>\n<td>创建发票记录</td>\n<td>审批、付款执行</td>\n<td>自建自批，虚假发票入账</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>匹配例外裁定</td>\n<td>解除匹配阻断</td>\n<td>录入、付款执行</td>\n<td>自己放进来的自己放行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审批</td>\n<td>批准付款</td>\n<td>录入、付款执行、主数据维护</td>\n<td>无对手方复核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>供应商主数据维护</td>\n<td>改银行账号与税号</td>\n<td>审批、付款执行</td>\n<td>改账号后自己批自己付</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>付款执行 / 放款</td>\n<td>发送付款指令</td>\n<td>上述全部</td>\n<td>付款权与信息修改权合一</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>跨境场景把这条矩阵拉长，因为多出的动作各自构成新的越权面：<strong>供应商银行账号变更</strong>（BEC 最经典落点：攻击者冒充供应商要求改收款账号）、<strong>预提税协定待遇的凭证维护</strong>（<a href=\"../payment-vat-crossborder/crossborder-fx-vat-withholding\">W-8 系列的收集与到期管理</a>）、<strong>制裁名单筛查与豁免</strong>。银行账号变更必须在系统层面强制<strong>双人复核 + 冷静期</strong>，而非靠&quot;我们会打电话确认&quot;——口头确认无法被审计重放。<a href=\"../matching-approval/approval-routing-segregation-of-duties\">审批路由、职责分离与审计轨迹</a> 已指出 SoD 规则是配置点；内控视角在此补上：<strong>每次角色/权限变更都必须是有审批、有留痕、有定期复核的事件</strong>。离职、转岗后未回收的账号是权限腐化的主要来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ap-度量指标体系\">AP 度量指标体系</h2><p>控制是否有效不能只靠&quot;我们设计了它&quot;，必须靠<strong>度量</strong>。AP 的度量分两组且必须同看——只盯效率会为降本牺牲控制，只盯风险会让 AP 变成什么都过不去的瓶颈。</p>\n<p>资金效率侧的核心是<strong>应付账款周转天数（DPO）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mtext>平均应付账款余额</mtext><mtext>销货成本 (COGS)</mtext></mfrac></mstyle><mo>×</mo><mtext>期间天数</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DPO = \\dfrac{\\text{平均应付账款余额}}{\\text{销货成本 (COGS)}} \\times \\text{期间天数}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2963em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">销货成本</span><span class=\"mord\"> (COGS)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">平均应付账款余额</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">期间天数</span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DPO</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span> 越高说明付款越晚、占用上游资金越多，但它是<strong>双刃</strong>的：拉长 DPO 会恶化供应商关系、可能丧失现金折扣、在供应集中度高的行业还会推高采购价。因此它必须与<strong>现金折扣捕获率</strong>配对看。供应商给出&quot;10 天内付款减 2%&quot;（2/10 net 30）时，放弃折扣的隐含年化成本为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mn>365</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{annual} = \\left(1 + \\frac{d}{1-d}\\right)^{\\frac{365}{N-n}} - 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ann</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7439em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7939em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter sizing reset-size3 size6\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8443em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.656em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2255em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line mtight\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.049em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.384em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">365</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4035em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter sizing reset-size3 size6\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 为折扣率、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 为折扣期、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 为信用期。代入 2/10 net 30：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.02</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>0.98</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mn>365</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>20</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>44.6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1 + 0.02/0.98)^{365/20} - 1 \\approx 44.6\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.138em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.02/0.98</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">365/20</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">44.6%</span></span></span></span></span>，远高于多数企业的边际资金成本：<strong>放弃这种折扣通常在财务上是错的</strong>，根源常常只是付款批次节奏没跟上折扣窗口。</p>\n<p>控制强度侧的几个比率可计算、可比较：无接触处理率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mtext>无人工干预即完成付款的发票数</mtext><mtext>发票总数</mtext></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= \\dfrac{\\text{无人工干预即完成付款的发票数}}{\\text{发票总数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">发票总数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">无人工干预即完成付款的发票数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，单位发票成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mtext>AP 期间总成本</mtext><mtext>期间处理发票数</mtext></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= \\dfrac{\\text{AP 期间总成本}}{\\text{期间处理发票数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">期间处理发票数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AP </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">期间总成本</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。无接触处理率越高、单位发票成本越低说明自动化越成功，但<strong>只有在例外率被同时控制住时才有意义</strong>——放宽容差可以瞬间抬高无接触率，代价是虚假发票与错误付款从预防层漏到检测层。这正是<a href=\"../matching-approval/tolerance-exception-matching-rules\">容差规则</a>与内控必须联合调参的原因。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>属于</th>\n<th>计算口径</th>\n<th>主要用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DPO</td>\n<td>资金效率</td>\n<td>平均应付余额 / COGS × 天数</td>\n<td>营运资金与条款谈判</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>折扣捕获率</td>\n<td>资金效率</td>\n<td>实际捕获折扣 / 可捕获折扣</td>\n<td>付款批次节奏调优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无接触处理率</td>\n<td>效率</td>\n<td>无人工干预发票 / 总发票</td>\n<td>自动化成熟度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>例外率</td>\n<td>效率+风险</td>\n<td>例外发票 / 总发票</td>\n<td>容差与主数据质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单位发票成本</td>\n<td>效率</td>\n<td>AP 总成本 / 处理量</td>\n<td>共享中心产能与外包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复付款率</td>\n<td>风险</td>\n<td>捕获的重复 / 已付款发票</td>\n<td>去重控制有效性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主数据变更率</td>\n<td>风险</td>\n<td>期间银行账号变更数</td>\n<td>BEC 攻击面监测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>付款周期时长</td>\n<td>效率</td>\n<td>入账到付款完成的中位天数</td>\n<td>合同与监管时限合规</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些数只有<strong>与基线及历史同期比较</strong>才有诊断力：&quot;例外率从 4% 升到 8%、新增例外集中在某三个供应商&quot;就是可直接追查的线索。</p>\n<h2 id=\"审计轨迹与可证明性\">审计轨迹与可证明性</h2><p>审计轨迹的最低标准是：<strong>每笔状态变更都能回答五个问题——谁、何时、改了什么、依据什么规则、原始输入是什么</strong>。它必须<strong>追加写、不可篡改</strong>，并与业务数据分离存放，使有权改业务数据的人无法同时改日志。</p>\n<p>几条值得写死在设计里的约束：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>决策要连同依据一起记</strong>。只记&quot;发票 #1234 于 14:02 被批准&quot;不够，要记&quot;依据容差规则 T-07（金额偏差 ≤2%），匹配得分 0.96，审批人 U-88&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>系统间传递要有可关联标识</strong>。付款指令里的发票号 reference 是把 AP 记录、银行流水、供应商到账回执串起来的键；<a href=\"../payment-vat-crossborder/payment-run-settlement-model\">付款通道模型</a> 中每笔付款都应携带稳定的业务引用。</li>\n<li><strong>保留期由法规而非直觉决定</strong>。各辖区对会计、税务、制裁筛查记录的保留年限要求不同（常见 5–10 年），跨境实体须按<strong>最长适用期</strong>保留<strong>可读的原始形态</strong>（扫描件、原始电子发票 XML、当时的规则版本），而非只有系统字段。</li>\n<li><strong>电子发票让&quot;发票即报文&quot;</strong>。欧盟 <a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/taxation/vat/vat-digital-age-vida_en\">ViDA 方案</a> 推动跨境 B2B 数字报告（2030 年 7 月起）后，发票数据本身成为申报报文，审计要求随之上移为&quot;结构合规&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>配置即控制</strong>。容差规则、SoD 规则、付款审批阈值都是配置，须纳入 IT 一般控制（ITGC）的变更管理并保留生效时间戳，使审计师能验证&quot;某笔交易发生时生效的是哪个版本&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"把指标反过来当控制信号\">把指标反过来当控制信号</h2><p>度量的第二重身份是<strong>连续监控</strong>：不是季末看一次报表，而是让异常本身触发调查工单——比事后抽样审计灵敏得多，因为舞弊的典型特征恰是&quot;停留在正常区间内、但分布形态变了&quot;。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>重复付款</strong>：同供应商 + 同发票号 + 同金额 + 相近日期，最易规则化。杠杆点是<strong>在付款前而非付款后跑</strong>——支付后再追回的成本与成功率都差一个量级。</li>\n<li><strong>主数据突变的时序特征</strong>：新供应商创建后短期内即收大额付款，或既有供应商银行账号在付款前数日内被改，都是 BEC 高危模式；价值在<strong>时序</strong>而不在单点数值。</li>\n<li><strong>审批行为的分布偏离</strong>：某审批人长期零驳回、审批时长中位数远低于同侪、或反复审批略低于其额度上限的金额（&quot;刚好差一点&quot;），都提示审批只是走过场。</li>\n<li><strong>数字分布检验</strong>：<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Benford%27s_law\">Benford 定律</a> 指出自然产生的多位数数据集首位为 1 的概率约 30.1%、为 9 的约 4.6%；真实发票金额一般服从，人为编造或篡改的金额常偏离。它只能作<strong>异常提示</strong>（受限额约束的数据天然不服从，须分层）。</li>\n<li><strong>损失规模基线</strong>：<a href=\"https://www.acfe.com/report-to-the-nations\">ACFE《Report to the Nations》</a> 长期给出的量级是舞弊损失约占组织收入的 <strong>5%</strong>，且发现周期中位数以年计、相当比例的案例由举报而非审计发现——AP 内控预算因此应前移到预防与高灵敏检测。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>控制按<strong>预防 / 检测 / 纠正</strong>三层布置，同一风险至少两层的规则相互独立；用<a href=\"https://www.theiia.org/en/content/position-papers/2020/the-iia-three-lines-model-an-update-of-the-three-lines-of-defense/\">三线模型</a>保证独立验证不落在执行者自己身上。</li>\n<li><strong>SoD 是被配置出来的</strong>：录入、例外裁定、审批、主数据维护、付款执行五个角色两两互斥；跨境额外看住<strong>银行账号变更</strong>（双人复核 + 冷静期）与<strong>协定凭证有效期</strong>。</li>\n<li>度量分两组同看：资金效率侧用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DPO</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span> 与<strong>折扣年化收益</strong>（2/10 net 30 约 44.6%）；控制强度侧用无接触处理率、例外率、单位发票成本、重复付款率、主数据变更率。</li>\n<li>审计轨迹须<strong>五问可答</strong>且追加写、与业务库分离；指标的第二重身份是<strong>连续监控信号</strong>（付款前重复检测、主数据变更时序、审批行为分布、<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Benford%27s_law\">Benford 定律</a> 检验）；约收入 5% 的损失基线（<a href=\"https://www.acfe.com/report-to-the-nations\">ACFE</a>）说明预算应前移到预防与高灵敏检测。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"AP 内控、度量指标与审计","id":"ap-内控-度量指标与审计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"职责分离在自动化 AP 中的落地","id":"职责分离在自动化-ap-中的落地"},{"level":2,"text":"AP 度量指标体系","id":"ap-度量指标体系"},{"level":2,"text":"审计轨迹与可证明性","id":"审计轨迹与可证明性"},{"level":2,"text":"把指标反过来当控制信号","id":"把指标反过来当控制信号"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"资金效率：DPO、早付折扣与供应链金融","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/accounts-payable-invoice-automation/ap-fraud-working-capital/working-capital-dpo-early-pay"},"next":null}